[00:35.00]Spirits broken
[00:37.51]Strength undone
[00:39.94]Shadows cast while the fight rages on
[00:44.80]Hope is falling
[00:46.61]Like the dust on the ground
[00:49.68]Nothing grows here no life to be found
[00:53.59]But one blade of grass
[00:56.26]Rises up from the earth
[00:59.36]Soon more will join her
[01:01.18]So she carries the burden
[01:03.45]Rises up through the storm
[01:05.84]So they can all touch the sky
[01:08.37]Waging war on all evil
[01:13.03]To put an end to the fight
[01:16.40]Kings and queens beat the drums
[01:20.81]With worlds to rule and kingdoms won
[01:25.71]The battles rage yet peace will come
[01:30.50]For she will sing Tomorrow's Song
[01:35.47]The earth will move the rivers will run
[01:40.54]Dynasties fall under the setting sun
[01:45.12]But just hold fast for peace will come
[01:49.93]For she will sing Tomorrow's Song
[02:24.12]Hopeless in her reverie
[02:27.87]All her strength is gone
[02:31.80]Every scar's a memory
[02:35.26]But she knows what must be done
[02:40.99]But one drop of rain
[02:42.94]Conjures the storm
